# `yarn lint` runs `eslint .`, and without this it walked the build and
# delivery output too: `delivery/` alone is ~210 MB (it vendors a Swagger UI
# bundle), `dist/` ~27 MB. Linting them took long enough that the script read
# as hung rather than slow, so in practice nobody ran it.
#
# Everything here is generated or third-party. The app's own sources —
# src/, App.tsx, index.js, __tests__/, and the config files — are still linted.

node_modules/

# Build output
android/
ios/
dist/
web-build/
coverage/
.expo/

# Client-facing delivery page and its vendored Swagger UI (delivery/README.md)
delivery/
delivery-report/

# Patch files are diffs, not source
patches/
